    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 9,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "I don't know about you, but it always make me sore when I see those war pictures -- all about flying leather- necks and submarine patrols and frogmen and guerillas in the Philippines."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 1,
        "line": 964,
        "text": "Maybe he just wanted to steal our wire cutters. Ever think of that?"
      }
